  "referenceHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1439\" class=\"elementor elementor-1439\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88c502c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"88c502c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df6c749 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"df6c749\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01d9285 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01d9285\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"325\">Using a combination of wheel-thrown and figurative vessels, Jacob creates bodies of work that are heavily influenced by his cultural background and heritage. <br>Fired in his soda gas kiln, his pieces display a wide range of deep colours and rich surface textures.<br><br></p><p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"568\">Jacob transforms London’s construction clay using the kilns he built himself. The introduction of this waste material has brought new and distinctive surface finishes to his work, particularly through the unpredictable nature of soda firing.<br><br></p><p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"842\">Within the figurative elements of his work, he incorporates pieces of natural slate and broken pottery collected from Britain’s coastlines and mountain ranges. These materials symbolise his Western heritage and express his cultural journey in a physical and creative form.<br><br></p><p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"963\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">For further information on pricing and availability for Jacob’s work, please contact<br><br data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"931\"><strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"963\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"961\">info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk</a></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cbb9cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9cbb9cb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a1acae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8a1acae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2545\" alt=\"Jacob Chan - Golden Earth Studio\" srcset=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-scaled.jpeg 1707w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-200x300.jpeg 200w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-683x1024.jpeg 683w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/DSCF1651-1-1365x2048.jpeg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1707px) 100vw, 1707px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\